{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>IMPORTANT: Game With Balls can only be played on a Steam Deck or with a controller that supports gyro. Tested with PS5 and Switch Pro controller. Keyboard and mouse are not supported.</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game With Balls! A little collection of handcrafted mazes for the Steam Deck, where you use gyro movement to navigate one of the balls through them. Are you the one with the best time among your friends... Or even in the world?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/98d35de559c12bad793f83f22f36f0a5.poster.avif?t=1770968679\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/98d35de559c12bad793f83f22f36f0a5.webm?t=1770968679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/98d35de559c12bad793f83f22f36f0a5.mp4?t=1770968679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted in the real world using real wood, drawings, and other materials, then converted for your digital pleasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges that not only test you on the time it takes to complete each level but also on other objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keeps track of your fastest times using Steam Leaderboards, so you can see if you\u2019re the quickest among your friends or the fastest in the world!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all secrets in every level to not only be the fastest but also the ultimate completist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack to relax to (or maybe not when you\u2019re trying to beat your friends\u2019 times).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/2bf9bdf95b8f5681c66d641a9b14ccf6.poster.avif?t=1770968679\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/2bf9bdf95b8f5681c66d641a9b14ccf6.webm?t=1770968679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/2bf9bdf95b8f5681c66d641a9b14ccf6.mp4?t=1770968679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/92bc4fa1db15e8f98e6f988a2bbfef0f.poster.avif?t=1770968679\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/92bc4fa1db15e8f98e6f988a2bbfef0f.webm?t=1770968679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/extras/92bc4fa1db15e8f98e6f988a2bbfef0f.mp4?t=1770968679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Kicked myself around","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3745250/c60092f8fa2a40a0743439263cb23c2b71bf62df.jpg"},{"name":"Was that PONG?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3745250/34cc35e51a1e1c31bdc848121887180a82e8996e.jpg"},{"name":"You took your time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3745250/084a4ba84d3ed9f2c15cdf4b611bc2b7052a3845.jpg"},{"name":"That was not that hard right?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3745250/bad8a1510b8de45838cdead1251e871e4f283aae.jpg"},{"name":"Ok... Are you an electrician?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3745250/9849ce9683b1c60b063e546dfc35d3b0a12755a5.jpg"},{"name":" You get a star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3745250/1dafbef635742ea02abfe2ab6442ba5728cc5834.jpg"},{"name":"Got to get them all!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3745250/09a2c6ce4ae3e52bfccab31062e48f04789d2296.jpg"},{"name":"Feed the dots","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3745250/43bc6031c9968624b7abd269e301f4fc98fbd2d5.jpg"},{"name":"Enough drawings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3745250/7ba520e81e553ec3e18afbcd5e83e53e89569ea1.jpg"},{"name":"Enough balls and wood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3745250/c844ff6b104b5748e89d53fca6de297f87715881.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745250?t=1770968679","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745250?t=1770968679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/9c78311b617726156e2ed987e1d03300e104923a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770968679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745250/9c78311b617726156e2ed987e1d03300e104923a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770968679","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}]